# Licensing

This repository is a fork of the REAL / AGI SDK project and is distributed
under two licenses.

## 1. Upstream REAL / AGI SDK code — Apache License 2.0

    Copyright 2025 AGI, Inc.

The agent run mechanics inherited from REAL (browser harness, task loop,
action/observation interface, and other upstream files) remain licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. The full text is in [`LICENSE-APACHE`](./LICENSE-APACHE).

This is a modified version of the original work: files have been changed,
removed, and added relative to upstream. The original copyright and license
notices are retained as required by the Apache License, Section 4.

## 2. New contributions — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)

    Copyright 2026 Gauntlet Bench

Contributions original to this fork — including the evaluation framework, the
batch runner, the objective and LLM-as-a-judge evaluators, the GauntletBench
task suites, and associated assets — are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License. The full text is in
[`LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0`](./LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0), and a summary is available at
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

## Which license applies to a given file?

Where a file carries its own license header, that header governs. Otherwise,
files derived from or originating in upstream REAL / AGI SDK are covered by the
Apache License 2.0, and files original to this fork are covered by CC BY 4.0.
Nothing here restricts the rights granted by the Apache License 2.0 over the
upstream portions.
